{
    "title": "FROME",
    "description": "First Round\u2019s On Me is the dating app for people who want to date intentionally and actually meet in person for a real date. Statistically, users are 100x more likely to go on a date using FROME compared to the other major dating apps. DatingAdvice.com praised us for our intentional and genuine approach to dating.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHOW WE HELP YOU MEET IN PERSON\r\n\r\nIn today\u2019s dating app world, singles are frustrated by endless small talk with pen pals, overwhelmed by a large number of matches, and rarely\u2014if ever\u2014actually meeting for a real date. First Round\u2019s On Me is changing the online dating game. We created an app that\u2019s designed to get you off the app and meet, in person, for a real date.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n* We give you a sense of who someone is. You\u2019ll get to know potential dates through their profile which includes photos, a bio, their unique answers to prompts, and other information including their personal preferences.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n* When you see someone you like, you send them a date invite as the first point of contact by choosing a type of drink, a day & time, and a venue. We make it simple to plan your first date, and we believe in being intentional with who you ask out rather than mindlessly swiping!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n* The receiver can accept, decline, or suggest a different date if they want to do something other than what the sender suggested.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n* Once the date is confirmed, the two users are locked in on their calendars for that day. The in-app messaging function only opens up 12 hours before your date is scheduled to start. We believe in getting to know someone in person rather than trying to through your phone screen.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n* Once you meet in person for your date, the rest is up to you. You got this!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHOW WE\u2019RE UNIQUE\r\n\r\n* We make it simple to plan your first date, taking off the pressure and allowing you to relax & enjoy your date.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n* You can only focus on one connection at a time. This puts value on each connection and means you won\u2019t be overwhelmed by a large number of matches and endless small talk with pen pals.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n* You will only connect with people who actually want to meet you.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe SKINNY ON FROME\r\n\r\n\u201cOur mission is to help people actually connect in real life,\u201d FROME\u2019s CEO told us. \u201cIn today\u2019s world, we have a lot of virtual connections, but human beings are becoming more isolated and lonely, which is ironic. I think that is because we forgot how important it is to connect in real life.\u201d - DatingAdvice.com \r\n\r\n\u201cThe app, which is designed to ensure users meet in person, is inspired by a time when people met organically instead of primarily on dating apps. With FROME, users get off their phones and together in real life.\u201d - Yahoo.com \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n* FROME is free to use, but we offer premium subscription options which give you a few perks, such as the ability to chat 24 hours before your date starts and the ability to save a profile for later.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSUBSCRIPTION INFO\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nYou may purchase an auto-renewing subscription through an in-app purchase.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2022 Auto-renewable subscription\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nOlive Subscription ($9.99)/month\r\n\r\nBlush Pink Subscription ($14.99)/month\r\n\r\nTerracotta Subscription ($24.99)/month\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2022 Your subscription will be charged to your Google Play account at confirmation of purchase and will automatically renew (monthly) unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2022 Current subscription may not be cancelled during the active subscription period; however, you can manage your subscription and/or turn off auto-renewal by visiting your Google Play Account Settings after purchase.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nTerms of use: https://firstroundsonme.co/copy-of-privacy/\r\n\r\nPrivacy policy: https://firstroundsonme.co/copy-of-survey/\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSupport@firstroundsonme.co\r\n\r\nLegal@firstroundsonme.co\r\n\r\nMarketing@firstroundsonme.co",
    "descriptionHTML": "First Round\u2019s On Me is the dating app for people who want to date intentionally and actually meet in person for a real date. Statistically, users are 100x more likely to go on a date using FROME compared to the other major dating apps. DatingAdvice.com praised us for our intentional and genuine approach to dating.<br><br><br><br>HOW WE HELP YOU MEET IN PERSON<br><br>In today\u2019s dating app world, singles are frustrated by endless small talk with pen pals, overwhelmed by a large number of matches, and rarely\u2014if ever\u2014actually meeting for a real date. First Round\u2019s On Me is changing the online dating game. We created an app that\u2019s designed to get you off the app and meet, in person, for a real date.<br><br><br><br>* We give you a sense of who someone is. You\u2019ll get to know potential dates through their profile which includes photos, a bio, their unique answers to prompts, and other information including their personal preferences.<br><br><br><br>* When you see someone you like, you send them a date invite as the first point of contact by choosing a type of drink, a day &amp; time, and a venue. We make it simple to plan your first date, and we believe in being intentional with who you ask out rather than mindlessly swiping!<br><br><br><br>* The receiver can accept, decline, or suggest a different date if they want to do something other than what the sender suggested.<br><br><br><br>* Once the date is confirmed, the two users are locked in on their calendars for that day. The in-app messaging function only opens up 12 hours before your date is scheduled to start. We believe in getting to know someone in person rather than trying to through your phone screen.<br><br><br><br>* Once you meet in person for your date, the rest is up to you. You got this!<br><br><br><br>HOW WE\u2019RE UNIQUE<br><br>* We make it simple to plan your first date, taking off the pressure and allowing you to relax &amp; enjoy your date.<br><br><br><br>* You can only focus on one connection at a time. This puts value on each connection and means you won\u2019t be overwhelmed by a large number of matches and endless small talk with pen pals.<br><br><br><br>* You will only connect with people who actually want to meet you.<br><br><br><br>The SKINNY ON FROME<br><br>\u201cOur mission is to help people actually connect in real life,\u201d FROME\u2019s CEO told us. \u201cIn today\u2019s world, we have a lot of virtual connections, but human beings are becoming more isolated and lonely, which is ironic. I think that is because we forgot how important it is to connect in real life.\u201d - DatingAdvice.com <br><br>\u201cThe app, which is designed to ensure users meet in person, is inspired by a time when people met organically instead of primarily on dating apps. With FROME, users get off their phones and together in real life.\u201d - Yahoo.com <br><br><br><br>* FROME is free to use, but we offer premium subscription options which give you a few perks, such as the ability to chat 24 hours before your date starts and the ability to save a profile for later.<br><br><br><br>SUBSCRIPTION INFO<br><br><br><br>You may purchase an auto-renewing subscription through an in-app purchase.<br><br><br><br>\u2022 Auto-renewable subscription<br><br><br><br>Olive Subscription ($9.99)/month<br><br>Blush Pink Subscription ($14.99)/month<br><br>Terracotta Subscription ($24.99)/month<br><br><br><br>\u2022 Your subscription will be charged to your Google Play account at confirmation of purchase and will automatically renew (monthly) unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.<br><br><br><br>\u2022 Current subscription may not be cancelled during the active subscription period; however, you can manage your subscription and/or turn off auto-renewal by visiting your Google Play Account Settings after purchase.<br><br><br><br>Terms of use: https://firstroundsonme.co/copy-of-privacy/<br><br>Privacy policy: https://firstroundsonme.co/copy-of-survey/<br><br><br><br>Support@firstroundsonme.co<br><br>Legal@firstroundsonme.co<br><br>Marketing@firstroundsonme.co",
